@startuml 图2-6 序列图：核发碳积分（UC-05 用例实现）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "定时任务 / 系统" as S
participant "TripHandler\n(httpserver/trips.go)" as H
participant "domain\n(points.go)" as D
database "MySQL\npoint_account / point_txn / point_batch" as DB

S -> H : carbonSavedG + 当日已发积分
H -> DB : SELECT COALESCE(SUM(amount),0)\nFROM point_txn ... 当日 TRAVEL
DB --> H : alreadyToday
H -> D : GrantPoints(carbonSavedG, rule, alreadyToday)
activate D
D -> D : raw = floor(carbonSavedG / 100)
D -> D : granted = min(raw, dailyCap − alreadyToday)
D --> H : {raw, granted, capped}
deactivate D
H -> DB : BEGIN
H -> DB : INSERT point_txn(TRAVEL, +granted)
H -> DB : UPDATE point_account\n(balance, total_saved_g, version)
H -> DB : INSERT point_batch\n(granted, remaining, expires_at)
H -> DB : COMMIT
H --> S : 本次积分 + 是否触顶

note over DB
  当前实现已写 point_txn / point_account / point_batch；
  批次不足已返回错误并回滚；剩余缺口是未过滤过期批次，
  图2-15 按“现状 + 缺口”标注，属 DEV-03。
end note
@enduml
